DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/snippets/{snippet_name}
Deletes a snippet belonging to the zone. Returns a 4XX response if the zone or snippet no longer exists.
Required: zone_id (path); snippet_name (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/snippets/{snippet_name}
Fetches a snippet belonging to the zone.
Required: zone_id (path); snippet_name (path)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/snippets/{snippet_name}
Creates or updates a snippet belonging to the zone.
Required: zone_id (path); snippet_name (path); body (body)
